WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:58.237 --> 00:01:03.017
These torn, torn, torn sentences...

00:01:03.928 --> 00:01:06.682
If I had studied in school, this 
would have been a book.

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:09.326
What did I do?

00:01:10.144 --> 00:01:11.108
I was selling clothes.

00:01:11.857 --> 00:01:13.326
I couldn't do anything for myself.

00:01:14.828 --> 00:01:16.035
For what, mom?

00:01:16.991 --> 00:01:19.599
To give you a good life.

00:01:20.573 --> 00:01:22.122
Made sure nothing ever hurt you.

00:01:22.877 --> 00:01:25.251
I worked hard to give you a good life.

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:27.424
I didn't put you in any trouble.

00:01:27.448 --> 00:01:29.995
I didn't hold any needle and thread in
your hands.

00:01:32.533 --> 00:01:36.673
All my life, mom, I spent my entire life
on this one, honest philosophy of dad.

00:01:38.271 --> 00:01:40.086
There is no purpose for my life,
right?

00:01:41.148 --> 00:01:42.548
She is questioning me today.

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:44.611
Although I became a driver for her.

00:01:44.635 --> 00:01:46.173
I became a guard, worked for others.

00:01:46.971 --> 00:01:48.551
Under Adil's favours, I died.

00:01:49.786 --> 00:01:53.208
Mom, I risked my life so that she can get
married with respect.

00:01:54.082 --> 00:01:56.342
And today she is questioning me and saying
that I am selfish.

00:02:00.228 --> 00:02:00.682
Go.

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:03.253
Go and grow your marriage.

00:02:03.533 --> 00:02:04.266
Sit in that house.

00:02:04.331 --> 00:02:05.699
And ruin my life.

00:02:07.364 --> 00:02:10.011
Why will you ruin your life, my child?

00:02:10.036 --> 00:02:10.511
Enough of this.

00:02:10.536 --> 00:02:11.900
No, my child.

00:02:11.928 --> 00:02:13.842
Why will you ruin your life?

00:02:15.293 --> 00:02:17.038
Only that will happen what my son wants.

00:02:17.062 --> 00:02:17.457
That's it.

00:02:17.498 --> 00:02:18.394
I said it.

00:02:18.824 --> 00:02:19.735
You  go.

00:02:19.916 --> 00:02:21.281
Do what you like.

00:02:21.306 --> 00:02:23.155
See your happiness.

00:02:23.313 --> 00:02:24.535
Leave everything else.

00:02:25.051 --> 00:02:26.328
I will see.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:29.424
I will see Jami l and Naheed.

00:02:35.913 --> 00:02:38.086
Enough of this, you stop crying.

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:40.900
Mom.

00:02:42.055 --> 00:02:43.424
You have forgotten me.

00:02:46.084 --> 00:02:47.848
Raja is right, Saira.

00:02:48.344 --> 00:02:49.642
We are wrong.

00:02:50.877 --> 00:02:52.066
Think about it.

00:02:52.482 --> 00:02:55.802
Have we ever asked him what he wanted?

00:02:55.906 --> 00:02:57.231
What did he want?

00:02:57.804 --> 00:02:59.375
Have we ever taken care of him?

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:00.302
No, right?

00:03:01.041 --> 00:03:01.583
That's it.

00:03:02.493 --> 00:03:06.149
We kept burdening him with out 
demands.  

00:03:07.177 --> 00:03:08.543
One afer the other.

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:13.329
and he did everything for us.

00:03:13.353 --> 00:03:15.111
What did he do for himself?

00:03:17.046 --> 00:03:20.797
Mom, my home is getting destroyed.

00:03:21.422 --> 00:03:23.673
His life is also getting destroyed,
right?

00:03:24.422 --> 00:03:24.831
No?

00:03:28.906 --> 00:03:30.357
What do you want from me?

00:03:32.102 --> 00:03:34.855
You want me to divorce and sit 
at home?

00:03:36.355 --> 00:03:41.562
Mom, I haven't even started my life with
Aamir properly.

00:03:43.178 --> 00:03:45.015
What do you want from me?

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:49.184
I just got married and now I come back and
sit in this house to die?

00:03:50.226 --> 00:03:52.431
Please care for me a little.

00:03:53.102 --> 00:03:55.633
Amir should take care of you,
right?

00:03:56.322 --> 00:03:59.148
You used to say that he loves you a lot.

00:03:59.502 --> 00:04:00.722
What happened to that love?

00:04:01.604 --> 00:04:02.935
That died in four days.

00:04:05.006 --> 00:04:09.630
I thought that he is educated,
he has seen the world, he has got a job,

00:04:09.655 --> 00:04:10.655
he has lived outside.

00:04:11.226 --> 00:04:14.733
But no, he has the same stupid thoughts.

00:04:16.046 --> 00:04:19.891
Look, he is going to divorce you because
of his sister and mother's stubbornness.

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:21.770
Is this some kind of thing to do?

00:04:23.556 --> 00:04:25.416
If Raja leaves his sister,

00:04:26.662 --> 00:04:27.722
what else will he do?

00:04:28.078 --> 00:04:29.996
He will keep listening to my tantrums
and attitudes.

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.616
He will have me sit on his head?

00:04:32.106 --> 00:04:34.126
He will also leave me, right mom?

00:04:35.533 --> 00:04:37.391
In fact, he has left me.

00:04:38.275 --> 00:04:40.119
Why don't you understand?

00:04:40.208 --> 00:04:42.842
This is the time for you to understand,
right child?

00:04:43.317 --> 00:04:47.525
Ask Amir, did he love
you on the condition

00:04:47.847 --> 00:04:50.655
that if his sister's home is settled,
he will settle with you?

00:04:51.783 --> 00:04:58.471
If I had married you off, if I had done this
marriage, then believe me, even I would

00:04:58.496 --> 00:05:00.025
have been very ashamed of this marriage
today.

00:05:02.915 --> 00:05:06.680
Now you are putting pressure on Raja again
and again.

00:05:06.971 --> 00:05:09.555
Why don't you ask Amir for the right to
love you?

00:05:16.652 --> 00:05:18.956
Son, sit down.

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:22.930
There is still time.

00:05:24.352 --> 00:05:26.086
Think about this.

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:28.483
Child, think about this with a cool mind.

00:05:39.877 --> 00:05:40.637
Now sit down.

00:05:41.914 --> 00:05:43.449
I will go and see Raja.

00:06:21.103 --> 00:06:22.574
Raja is in the market again today.

00:06:25.395 --> 00:06:27.564
He has left the market and yet
he still can't leave. 

00:06:29.194 --> 00:06:31.125
That's the way the heart goes, brother.

00:06:32.694 --> 00:06:36.634
Once it attaches somewhere, 
you stay there.

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:42.449
Something is going on in my head.

00:06:45.943 --> 00:06:48.145
How can love be the enemy of love?

00:06:50.365 --> 00:06:52.596
Shouldn't love support love.

00:06:58.207 --> 00:06:59.456
What's the matter, brother?

00:07:00.732 --> 00:07:05.447
You always say it to me and today you are
talking about difficult things.

00:07:09.009 --> 00:07:10.476
You are right.

00:07:12.042 --> 00:07:13.997
You can't find life in a simple life.

00:07:16.704 --> 00:07:18.275
Stop Raja, brother.

00:07:19.008 --> 00:07:20.008
Where is he going?

00:07:20.264 --> 00:07:21.264
Where is he going?

00:07:21.911 --> 00:07:23.291
He just came to the market.

00:07:25.502 --> 00:07:26.966
Your Raja is gone.

00:07:55.725 --> 00:07:57.693
I am creating a voice.

00:08:04.028 --> 00:08:07.457
I am still living the dream I had.

00:08:08.927 --> 00:08:11.142
I put my life on the line...

00:08:12.295 --> 00:08:15.408
I am making new
deals... all the time.

00:08:18.151 --> 00:08:20.431
I am drinking the poison of life...

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:24.829
from my lips.

00:08:40.043 --> 00:08:40.936
Raja...

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:49.143
Yea it was a bit difficult.

00:08:49.955 --> 00:08:50.897
Ok, bye.

00:08:58.614 --> 00:09:00.139
What was the need to do all this? 

00:09:01.414 --> 00:09:03.247
I did not have this expectation from you.

00:09:03.418 --> 00:09:06.907
I did not expect a lot of things either,
and yet they happened in front of my eyes.

00:09:07.234 --> 00:09:09.083
This conversation was between the two
of us right?

00:09:09.727 --> 00:09:10.833
It could have stayed that way.

00:09:11.542 --> 00:09:13.167
You did not need to advertise it.

00:09:13.396 --> 00:09:14.076
Advertisement?

00:09:14.749 --> 00:09:16.880
Now you're saying it was between the
two of us?

00:09:18.205 --> 00:09:20.579
We both never had a thing maybe, Raja.

00:09:20.839 --> 00:09:22.111
It was just one-sided.

00:09:22.291 --> 00:09:24.562
So why are you obsessed with trying 
to make it two-sided?

00:09:27.359 --> 00:09:30.906
When it's right to lie to
someone after knowing their feelings,

00:09:31.384 --> 00:09:33.698
then it's also
right to be stubborn in love.

00:09:33.893 --> 00:09:35.293
I didn't lie to you.

00:09:35.699 --> 00:09:37.159
You lied to me.

00:09:37.465 --> 00:09:39.574
You lied to me by putting a ring with your
name on me,

00:09:39.853 --> 00:09:42.735
and keeping me in the dark while running
away with Rania was not a lie?

00:09:42.951 --> 00:09:45.764
Man, I wanted to tell you everything.

00:09:46.151 --> 00:09:47.848
You didn't want to tell me anything.

00:09:48.046 --> 00:09:49.671
You wanted to hide it from me.

00:09:49.775 --> 00:09:51.655
That's a different matter that I found out
myself.

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:54.256
You think we'll get married if you keep
this stubbornness.

00:09:54.751 --> 00:09:56.459
You were never mine, Raja.

00:09:56.883 --> 00:09:58.453
There's nothing wrong in trying.

00:10:01.377 --> 00:10:03.819
For God's sake Saba, stop being stubborn.

00:10:04.555 --> 00:10:06.195
Think with some brain and some intellect.

00:10:06.728 --> 00:10:08.848
Go and explain to your mother and brother.

00:10:08.872 --> 00:10:09.966
Take your wife with you.

00:10:10.442 --> 00:10:11.766
You're ruining two houses.

00:10:13.026 --> 00:10:15.335
Bring the wedding procession along with Sister
Saira.

00:10:15.857 --> 00:10:17.804
Take me and Sister Saira will
stay at home.

00:10:23.948 --> 00:10:25.339
Someone should try explaining to her.

00:10:40.884 --> 00:10:42.311
The door is locked.

00:10:42.677 --> 00:10:44.277
It seems as if Buddha has gone with her.

00:11:02.936 --> 00:11:05.616
The happiness of success is clearly
visible on your face.

00:11:09.949 --> 00:11:11.341
Our destination is not far.

00:11:13.698 --> 00:11:18.723
Power, name, seat, politics.

00:11:19.552 --> 00:11:21.903
All that you brought with you in this
house.

00:11:23.227 --> 00:11:26.627
Very soon, it will become your property
again.

00:11:29.942 --> 00:11:31.936
I have been waiting for this day for
years.

00:11:32.395 --> 00:11:33.975
Your wait is about to end.

00:11:35.086 --> 00:11:36.206
Have you seen Adil?

00:11:37.613 --> 00:11:39.359
How he is preparing for his wedding.

00:11:40.697 --> 00:11:43.317
Preparing for the guest house,
media coverage.

00:11:44.302 --> 00:11:45.742
He is calling his friends from outside.

00:11:46.791 --> 00:11:51.395
And that Raja has already made a plan to
elope with Rani.

00:11:53.991 --> 00:11:59.022
That Raja on whom he trusted so much after
leaving the whole world.

00:12:00.441 --> 00:12:04.480
And that Rani, who he started
loving so much that

00:12:05.353 --> 00:12:07.867
he decided to get
married at the first sight.

00:12:13.113 --> 00:12:15.337
Planning and Development Authority.

00:12:15.997 --> 00:12:17.757
Minister Adil Sultan.

00:12:19.706 --> 00:12:21.128
He couldn't recognize two people.

00:12:30.507 --> 00:12:31.627
What decision did you make?

00:12:31.944 --> 00:12:33.304
When are you bringing the wedding?

00:12:33.788 --> 00:12:35.797
Raja will not marry Saba.

00:12:37.311 --> 00:12:40.968
Do you guys have any idea that
with the decision of yours 

00:12:40.993 --> 00:12:42.853
what outcome it will bring
for your family?

00:12:43.606 --> 00:12:50.312
Amil, the way you care for Saba's happiness,
the same way I care for Raja as well.

00:12:51.475 --> 00:12:52.664
He is my brother.

00:12:53.751 --> 00:12:54.280
Okay.

00:12:54.876 --> 00:12:55.907
And your life?

00:12:56.646 --> 00:12:57.719
And our happiness?

00:12:58.566 --> 00:13:00.228
Do you have any idea about this?

00:13:01.428 --> 00:13:02.877
My life?

00:13:03.982 --> 00:13:04.822
My happiness?

00:13:08.115 --> 00:13:11.073
If the relationship breaks, it won't be 
just mine?

00:13:13.275 --> 00:13:16.375
Our relationship is made on the basis of
love, Amir.

00:13:19.624 --> 00:13:25.864
And when relationships break, the losses
come in the share of both.

00:13:30.094 --> 00:13:35.366
If the loss is only mine, then I will 
understand

00:13:38.408 --> 00:13:40.555
that I also loved alone.

00:13:53.216 --> 00:13:53.755
Raja?

00:13:54.627 --> 00:13:55.169
Yes?

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:57.375
How will our house be?

00:13:59.895 --> 00:14:00.624
Completely big.

00:14:03.782 --> 00:14:04.607
Full mansion.

00:14:05.478 --> 00:14:06.411
Not big.

00:14:06.751 --> 00:14:07.279
Small one.

00:14:10.078 --> 00:14:11.032
Small home?

00:14:11.393 --> 00:14:12.167
Yes.

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:19.996
Just look, Look, we have a small house and
a cute balcony in it.

00:14:20.624 --> 00:14:22.908
From which we can see all four seasons.

00:14:25.653 --> 00:14:26.484
Where...

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:30.084
Where there is no stopping us in the
heat of the winters. 

00:14:32.491 --> 00:14:33.491
Where...

00:14:35.912 --> 00:14:39.757
Where the sound of the rain wakes us up.

00:14:41.037 --> 00:14:44.517
Where there is no difference in the fragrance of 
flowers and your presence.

00:14:49.091 --> 00:14:53.564
Where there is a strong competition between 
you and the colors of spring.

00:14:54.055 --> 00:14:55.055
Competition?

00:14:56.362 --> 00:14:57.597
I will be the umpire.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.344
Then I will win.

00:14:59.895 --> 00:15:01.455
Nothing happens without a bribe.

00:15:02.031 --> 00:15:03.595
You are asking for a bribe?

00:15:03.642 --> 00:15:05.035
What a hand you have? 

00:15:05.060 --> 00:15:05.795
You hit so hard.

00:15:06.193 --> 00:15:07.598
Why are you still asking for a bribe?

00:15:07.995 --> 00:15:08.899
What else should I ask for?

00:15:10.215 --> 00:15:11.899
Okay, I am sorry.

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:13.520
You have a 0.75 kilo hand. 

00:15:13.928 --> 00:15:16.323
My hand doesn't hit that hard.

00:15:16.348 --> 00:15:16.875
It does.

00:15:17.300 --> 00:15:19.110
Okay, Okay. 

00:15:19.135 --> 00:15:20.306
Okay, I am sorry.

00:15:35.275 --> 00:15:36.319
Hello Raja.

00:15:36.986 --> 00:15:38.071
Where are you lost?

00:15:38.144 --> 00:15:39.739
You didn't call or message me.

00:15:40.792 --> 00:15:43.032
I wish I had the option to disappear
today.

00:15:44.462 --> 00:15:45.337
Yes, true.

00:15:45.749 --> 00:15:47.095
Then both of us will disappear.

00:15:47.889 --> 00:15:50.569
By the way, where do we go after
disappearing?

00:15:50.846 --> 00:15:52.988
At this time, we won't even get a
visa for hell.

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:53.780
Hell?

00:15:54.573 --> 00:15:56.093
I don't go to hell.

00:15:56.393 --> 00:15:57.931
We could have planned for somewhere else.

00:15:59.928 --> 00:16:00.928
You are right.

00:16:01.431 --> 00:16:02.791
You are amazing in your own world.

00:16:04.395 --> 00:16:04.929
What happened?

00:16:04.953 --> 00:16:05.811
Are you worried?

00:16:07.268 --> 00:16:10.491
Saba is crying about getting married.

00:16:12.927 --> 00:16:14.242
I will talk to you later.

00:16:15.641 --> 00:16:16.494
Okay.

00:16:31.216 --> 00:16:31.989
Will you have tea?

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:42.000
You are upset at me?

00:16:50.173 --> 00:16:53.124
I have refused Amir.

00:17:01.227 --> 00:17:03.247
We will not get you married to Saba.

00:17:11.778 --> 00:17:13.863
Hey, now smile.

00:17:25.716 --> 00:17:26.377
Have tea.

00:17:55.787 --> 00:17:58.036
There is no response from Asifa's side.

00:17:59.464 --> 00:18:04.180
I thought she will see her daughter at the
footstep of her home and come running to us.

00:18:05.772 --> 00:18:09.567
You call Saira, ask her, what have
they thought?

00:18:10.471 --> 00:18:11.279
I... 

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:14.326
I did call mother.

00:18:14.931 --> 00:18:16.771
Really, what did she say then?

00:18:19.995 --> 00:18:22.382
From what Saira is saying...

00:18:24.516 --> 00:18:25.126
Maybe...

00:18:25.864 --> 00:18:27.753
they are refusing to get married.

00:18:29.468 --> 00:18:30.033
What?

00:18:31.224 --> 00:18:32.166
Did she say that?

00:18:35.906 --> 00:18:36.466
Yes, mother.

00:18:40.484 --> 00:18:44.344
If I don't get married to
Raja... then I will kill myself.

00:18:47.711 --> 00:18:48.162
Saba.

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:48.995
Saba.

00:18:49.571 --> 00:18:50.197
Saba.

00:18:57.815 --> 00:19:00.553
What have you done in front of your
brother?

00:19:00.888 --> 00:19:01.988
What is this madness?

00:19:02.996 --> 00:19:03.996
This is not madness.

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:05.064
I have gone mad.

00:19:05.658 --> 00:19:06.938
You are not understanding.

00:19:06.962 --> 00:19:09.042
Mom, Raja and Rani are leaving the
country.

00:19:09.195 --> 00:19:11.751
Once they get married, we will not be able
to do anything.

00:19:12.326 --> 00:19:13.066
Quiet down.

00:19:13.173 --> 00:19:13.731
He will listen.

00:19:13.755 --> 00:19:15.359
It's good that he listens.

00:19:15.384 --> 00:19:17.591
Maybe he will think of me after listening.

00:19:18.296 --> 00:19:19.896
Have some respect , Saba.

00:19:20.303 --> 00:19:21.376
What has happened to you?

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:23.615
You are saying anything that is coming
to your mind.

00:19:24.186 --> 00:19:27.346
Mom, don't think of this as my threat or
anger.

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:30.479
If I don't get married to Raja,
I will kill myself.

00:19:42.587 --> 00:19:44.619
I will support you both.

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:50.331
I will get my daughter married with my own
hands.

00:19:51.348 --> 00:19:52.728
I will bring her home.

00:19:58.707 --> 00:20:00.951
Just dear, these relationships.

00:20:01.745 --> 00:20:05.034
If there is distance in them,
they cause cracks.

00:20:06.863 --> 00:20:11.626
Yes, if a person tries, those cracks
can be filled.

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:16.700
One should always try.

00:20:20.854 --> 00:20:21.618
Okay.

00:20:42.622 --> 00:20:44.168
Okay, I will talk to you then.

00:20:44.393 --> 00:20:44.815
Okay.

00:20:45.017 --> 00:20:45.431
Good bye.

00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:47.880
Greetings, dad.

00:20:47.957 --> 00:20:48.957
Greetings, child.

00:20:57.791 --> 00:21:02.237
Dad, I want to talk to you about something
very important.

00:21:02.838 --> 00:21:03.338
Yes, tell me.

00:21:03.362 --> 00:21:03.971
I'm listening.

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:10.751
Look, dad, I got engaged to Adil
as per your instructions.

00:21:12.599 --> 00:21:15.442
We've spent time together, but...

00:21:15.885 --> 00:21:19.054
Dad, we
don't have any understanding between us.

00:21:20.131 --> 00:21:21.506
Has Adil said something?

00:21:22.375 --> 00:21:23.844
I'll talk to him myself.

00:21:29.686 --> 00:21:31.315
Do you want to say something to me?

00:21:32.644 --> 00:21:33.329
Say it openly.

00:21:33.353 --> 00:21:33.922
I'm listening.

00:21:38.838 --> 00:21:42.175
Dad, I don't think I should marry Adil.

00:21:42.888 --> 00:21:43.439
What?

00:21:44.824 --> 00:21:45.497
What are you saying?

00:21:49.435 --> 00:21:51.764
Dad, I don't want to marry Adil.

00:21:53.092 --> 00:21:55.280
Breaking the engagement
with Adil Sultan

00:21:56.127 --> 00:21:58.047
will be the biggest
humiliation in the world.

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:01.344
Dad, my heart isn't listening.

00:22:01.416 --> 00:22:02.035
What do I do?

00:22:02.393 --> 00:22:05.253
Such a good proposal and you're denying
it?

00:22:06.197 --> 00:22:08.153
I won't allow you to do this humiliation
at all.

00:22:08.495 --> 00:22:10.326
Dad, I'm not happy.

00:22:11.362 --> 00:22:13.853
This whole relationship seems like a
pressure to me.

00:22:14.386 --> 00:22:16.875
And I can't spend my entire life in this
pressure.

00:22:18.379 --> 00:22:19.379
I understand.

00:22:21.102 --> 00:22:22.115
I'm your father.

00:22:23.144 --> 00:22:24.726
I've lived quite a life.

00:22:27.028 --> 00:22:28.617
If there's any other guy, tell me.

00:22:30.206 --> 00:22:30.722
Yes.

00:22:33.031 --> 00:22:34.604
Can I know who he is?

00:22:35.522 --> 00:22:38.228
Because of whom you're ruining your
whole life?

00:22:51.093 --> 00:22:53.324
Ra.. ra... Raja.

00:22:54.193 --> 00:22:55.068
Raja?

00:22:55.759 --> 00:22:56.928
The one from the thrift market?

00:22:58.355 --> 00:23:01.286
You are giving up your life for him?

00:23:02.062 --> 00:23:04.895
Father, he is a very good boy.

00:23:06.617 --> 00:23:10.857
That means Iman and Rayan had a good doubt
about each other.

00:23:16.808 --> 00:23:21.190
Father, look, I have never asked for
anything from you in my entire life.

00:23:22.193 --> 00:23:23.913
I am asking for one thing.

00:23:23.937 --> 00:23:25.115
Please listen to me.

00:23:26.306 --> 00:23:27.586
Do you know what you are saying?

00:23:29.433 --> 00:23:30.553
We will be on the streets.

00:23:31.962 --> 00:23:34.362
All our investments are in Adil Sultan's
hands.

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:36.089
I will not let you do this at all.

00:23:36.371 --> 00:23:39.697
Father, you are more concerned about your
business than my happiness.

00:23:39.841 --> 00:23:44.313
For every happiness, whether
it is yours or someone else's,

00:23:45.164 --> 00:23:48.279
money are as
important as a breath for life.

00:23:50.622 --> 00:23:52.126
But you will not understand this.

00:23:54.311 --> 00:23:57.446
Your eyes have a veil of love for Raja.

00:23:58.860 --> 00:24:05.438
When you will leave this house and this
palace, then you will realize your mistake.

00:24:06.242 --> 00:24:08.018
Father, I don't understand
what I should do with

00:24:08.125 --> 00:24:10.885
this money and this
palace when I am not happy.

00:24:11.591 --> 00:24:13.171
What is the use of these things?

00:24:14.062 --> 00:24:15.299
You can say anything.

00:24:16.375 --> 00:24:18.291
I will never let you do this stupid thing.

00:24:20.075 --> 00:24:22.571
And I don't want to hear
anything like this from you.

00:24:22.915 --> 00:24:23.799
Do you understand?

00:24:51.726 --> 00:24:52.535
First profit.

00:24:55.437 --> 00:24:57.613
Which can turn into loss at any time.

00:24:59.713 --> 00:25:00.104
What?

00:25:00.786 --> 00:25:01.884
Why are you talking like this?

00:25:02.693 --> 00:25:03.999
We are out of these issues.

00:25:05.320 --> 00:25:07.760
I have seen everything and you are saying
such a stupid thing.

00:25:09.428 --> 00:25:14.842
I just want to tell you to remove the
umbrella before it rains.

00:25:18.542 --> 00:25:19.200
Why?

00:25:19.913 --> 00:25:20.616
Has something happened?

00:25:21.040 --> 00:25:21.964
From Adil's side?

00:25:23.488 --> 00:25:24.668
Not from Adil's side.

00:25:25.375 --> 00:25:26.615
From Rania's side.

00:25:28.904 --> 00:25:30.784
Rania wants to end the relationship with
Adil.

00:25:36.408 --> 00:25:37.048
Why?

00:25:37.886 --> 00:25:38.697
What happened?

00:25:40.302 --> 00:25:41.444
This is her decision.

00:25:44.477 --> 00:25:45.548
You didn't talk to her?

00:25:46.042 --> 00:25:47.579
Explain it to her.

00:25:48.248 --> 00:25:50.295
But this is a matter of foolishness.

00:25:53.148 --> 00:25:55.179
Because of this two-bit Raja.

00:25:56.495 --> 00:25:57.508
She wants him.

00:26:04.893 --> 00:26:06.117
I had a doubt about this.

00:26:06.860 --> 00:26:07.677
And that's what happened.

00:26:08.930 --> 00:26:11.619
I am worried about
the fact that if she has

00:26:11.643 --> 00:26:15.087
mentioned this to Adil,
then what will happen?

00:26:20.464 --> 00:26:21.464
You don't worry.

00:26:24.200 --> 00:26:25.320
I will talk to him.

00:26:40.195 --> 00:26:42.084
Amir, come here.

00:26:42.879 --> 00:26:43.444
Sit down.

00:26:44.649 --> 00:26:46.094
I need to talk to you.

00:26:54.868 --> 00:26:55.495
Yes, mom.

00:26:57.798 --> 00:27:00.879
Send Saira to the first divorce right now.

00:27:03.206 --> 00:27:05.564
Naheed, fear God.

00:27:06.024 --> 00:27:07.913
What are you asking Amir to do?

00:27:10.468 --> 00:27:13.868
Divorce is a very disliked act in the eyes
of God.

00:27:14.753 --> 00:27:17.037
Fear God, you have your own daughter too.

00:27:17.477 --> 00:27:20.464
I know very well that I have a daughter too.

00:27:21.017 --> 00:27:24.855
And that very daughter of mine is
threatening me with suicide.

00:27:25.824 --> 00:27:26.295
What?

00:27:27.591 --> 00:27:31.979
Saba can go to such an extent that she
threatens to commit suicide?

00:27:34.457 --> 00:27:36.657
She has gone to such an extent,
Mr. Jamil.

00:27:37.477 --> 00:27:40.291
And it's Asi fa's fault in all this.

00:27:41.551 --> 00:27:44.377
She should not have called her home and
get her to follow.

00:27:45.988 --> 00:27:49.646
and she should not have found a rich girl
and ignored us.

00:27:50.826 --> 00:27:57.022
I am telling you, call Saira right now and
tell her that if Raja doesn't agree,

00:27:57.246 --> 00:27:59.531
she will get her first divorce by
tomorrow.

00:28:03.078 --> 00:28:06.021
Mom, I was saying
that you once... 

00:28:06.046 --> 00:28:06.572
Enough.

00:28:07.117 --> 00:28:09.177
I am not going to listen to your nonsense
anymore.

00:28:09.993 --> 00:28:11.488
Your father is enough for that.

00:28:14.462 --> 00:28:15.713
Asifa won't listen like this.

00:28:17.316 --> 00:28:20.894
You will have to call
Saira and tell her that

00:28:21.509 --> 00:28:23.238
she should be ready for her
first divorce tomorrow.

00:28:25.248 --> 00:28:27.657
Never make your own daughter understand.

00:28:28.251 --> 00:28:30.533
Always get up and go to someone else's
home.

00:28:31.655 --> 00:28:33.504
All this that has happened to Saba.

00:28:34.797 --> 00:28:38.268
This is all because of your stubbornness.

00:28:38.770 --> 00:28:39.799
And what about you?

00:28:40.414 --> 00:28:43.982
Both you and Asifa are equal in this.

00:28:44.117 --> 00:28:45.417
Both of you are guilty.

00:28:47.128 --> 00:28:51.319
These days, what silly spiritual practices
have you been reading.

00:28:52.371 --> 00:28:54.308
Don't you see the happiness of your own
child?

00:28:54.882 --> 00:28:59.108
Whenever you open your mouth, you open
your mouth in favour of Asifa's home.

00:29:01.033 --> 00:29:05.484
There is no way that you either agree with
someone or listen to someone else.

00:29:11.537 --> 00:29:12.142
Wait.

00:29:15.946 --> 00:29:17.666
Saira should get her first divorce
tomorrow.

00:29:18.951 --> 00:29:19.577
Understood?

00:29:21.924 --> 00:29:22.595
Yes, mom.

00:29:30.505 --> 00:29:32.161
Yes, Raja took me.

00:29:32.709 --> 00:29:34.250
When are you coming?

00:29:36.225 --> 00:29:38.132
Oh, no.

00:29:38.185 --> 00:29:42.241
If you want to spend a few more days in
Turkey, you can do that.

00:29:48.442 --> 00:29:50.271
Brother Ayaan is here.

00:29:50.296 --> 00:29:51.072
I'll call you later.

00:29:51.097 --> 00:29:51.759
Okay?

00:29:55.820 --> 00:29:57.271
You are making Adil a fool too?

00:29:58.002 --> 00:29:59.162
You have made us one.

00:30:00.546 --> 00:30:01.979
So dad told you too.

00:30:03.360 --> 00:30:04.053
So obviously.

00:30:04.940 --> 00:30:05.875
We are a family.

00:30:07.915 --> 00:30:08.915
Family?

00:30:09.831 --> 00:30:11.457
Brother Ayaan, we have become a family?

00:30:11.931 --> 00:30:12.753
That's a big deal!

00:30:14.817 --> 00:30:15.706
We are a family.

00:30:16.620 --> 00:30:18.775
There are a hundred fights in every
family.

00:30:19.395 --> 00:30:20.520
And there are a hundred solutions.

00:30:20.544 --> 00:30:21.846
Family remains one.

00:30:22.982 --> 00:30:26.102
Brother Ayaan, you guys never saw me
as a family member.

00:30:27.117 --> 00:30:30.564
If you are accepting me even today,
then only for your benefit.

00:30:31.231 --> 00:30:33.251
For your business and for your luxuries.

00:30:37.151 --> 00:30:37.857
Think about it.

00:30:38.771 --> 00:30:40.926
Instead of Adil, that Raja?

00:30:42.677 --> 00:30:45.233
Brother Ayaan, you will never understand.

00:30:45.933 --> 00:30:48.166
And neither will I try to make you
understand.

00:30:50.371 --> 00:30:52.277
This will be your biggest mistake.

00:30:53.766 --> 00:30:55.211
I have made my decision.

00:30:55.988 --> 00:30:58.313
And I will not want to talk about this
with you again.

00:31:21.460 --> 00:31:22.731
No dad.

00:31:25.700 --> 00:31:26.700
She has refused.

00:31:27.649 --> 00:31:28.689
She has made her decision.

00:31:28.713 --> 00:31:29.184
She is not agreeing.

00:31:34.280 --> 00:31:36.080
Adil is still out of the country.

00:31:37.717 --> 00:31:39.377
This thing is between us right now.

00:31:41.326 --> 00:31:42.626
Adil doesn't know about this.

00:31:43.738 --> 00:31:45.915
We will have to stop Rania from
this recklessness somehow.

00:31:47.042 --> 00:31:48.162
This is her attitude.

00:31:49.420 --> 00:31:52.155
Whenever she wants, she can refuse Adil.

00:31:52.815 --> 00:31:54.855
And her refusal is our destruction.

00:31:56.177 --> 00:31:57.666
I don't understand what to do.

